#~ "для внешнего вызова."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Transactions are built on a two-"
#~ "phase commit and extend through records"
#~ " calls to neighboring applications. A "
#~ "rollback will also undo whatever they"
#~ " managed to write — including any "
#~ "service records created by the "
#~ "integration for the external call."

#~ msgid "**Блокировки живут столько же, сколько чужой сервис отвечает**"
#~ msgstr "**Locks Live as Long as the Other Service Takes to Respond**"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Транзакция, растянутая на HTTP-вызов третьей"
